Dear Sir or Madam,

I write as the Claimant in Zahmoul v Secretary of State for Justice & HMCTS=
 (Administrative Court reference AC-2025-LON-004293).

This email is sent as a continuity notice. The Judicial Review is live, con=
cerns the administrative handling of court-controlled electronic material, a=
nd is being maintained as a matter of public record.

A public archive of officially filed and lawfully publishable materials, in=
cluding evidential documents and narrative analysis, is maintained at the li=
nk below for transparency and continuity of record:

https://github.com/nadiazahmoul/JR-Zahmoul-v-SSJ-HMCTS-Archive

This notice is provided to ensure clarity as to the existence, status, and =
location of the record of proceedings.

Yours faithfully,

Nadia Zahmoul

